pr233.jsonl contains the inputs of the test cases in test/corpus/java25.txt from
https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-java/pull/233 (author: arraypress, head 93426133ad4e, closed
unmerged on 2026-10-02): "Record pattern qualified", "Module import", "Flexible ctor" and
"Switch final type pattern". Only the input texts were kept. The expected trees of that file were not
imported; this repository records its own baseline trees (oracle/data/expected-failures.json) and the
javac verdicts (oracle/data/verdicts).

